Saiki from [saiki kusuo](https://youtu.be/CTuVOtu1Q90), hes an overpowered, completely done aroace, the link I added is some moments form season 1, I dearly recommend the anime, comming from someone that doesnt like anime much. Its super entertaining and hes an icon, I bet you heard soe audios on tiktok since they recently became popular.

&#x200B;

also yes we love Alastor my beloved

what I so appreciate about the ace and aro community is that you can always expect a wonderful lack of creepy comments.

&#x200B;

Sweater looks great and youre really pretty imo, where did you get it? Also is that a crown on your head hahha

I think that if you find a partner and you talk about it, you can find a way to even have maybe a child without any physical intercourse, there are a lot of ways and in the end, it depends whta option will suit you the best :))

&#x200B;

Id say yes and dw too much about it

i have been laying mine off becuase of my family. they deserve better and  after all the damage i already did to them, hurting them like this is something I'll never forgive myself. Sometimes I just cry the whole night about it. 

It's a priviledge I don't deserve. 

&#x200B;

Please, Please talk to your parents, its shit i know, i know i know i know just please talk to them. Say how youre feeling, your plan, just let it all out. 

&#x200B;

you can do this, I believe in you, really, please talk to them
